 Debian 13 (trixie) arm64 + ClockworkPi A04 kernel 5.10.75

  Login:        devterm / devterm   (root password is also devterm)
  Change them:  passwd ; sudo passwd root
  Wi-Fi:        nmtui-go     or  devterm-wifi <SSID> <password>
  Browser:      devterm-kiosk https://example.com
  Fonts:        devterm-font  (list or switch console fonts)
  Printer:      devterm-printer "hello"   or  devterm-thermal-test

  Console font is Paper Mono Nerd Font.  The panel is rotated 90 degrees
  by the kernel command line (fbcon=rotate:1), giving 1280x480 text.
